    "status": "Completed",
    "content": "<ProjectHero\r\n  title=\"HireCrowd\"\r\n  subtitle=\"Unified MERN-based hiring ecosystem with integrated Applicant Tracking System (ATS), transforming how recruiters manage candidate pipelines.\"\r\n  status=\"Completed\"\r\n  timeline=\"3 Months\"\r\n  github=\"https://github.com/AmitxParmar/job-portal-mern\"\r\n  demo=\"https://job-portal-mern-sigma.vercel.app/\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n<InfoGrid>\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Architecture\" value=\"Monolith\" icon={Layout} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Frontend\" value=\"React\" icon={Layout} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Backend\" value=\"Express\" icon={Server} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Database\" value=\"MongoDB\" icon={Database} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"State\" value=\"React Query\" icon={Activity} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Auth\" value=\"JWT + RBAC\" icon={Shield} />\r\n</InfoGrid>\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nHireCrowd is a comprehensive hiring platform designed to bridge the gap between job seekers and recruiters. It features a robust ATS (Applicant Tracking System) that allows recruiters to manage the entire hiring lifecycle from a single dashboard.\r\n\r\nKey focus areas:\r\n- Seamless candidate experience\r\n- Efficient recruiter workflow\r\n- Real-time application tracking\r\n- Scalable state management\r\n\r\n<ProjectArchitecture \r\n  title=\"HireCrowd System Blueprint\"\r\n  description=\"A high-performance MERN architecture utilizing an API Gateway pattern for scalable service management and real-time candidate processing.\"\r\n  nodes={[\r\n    { id: '1', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 0 }, data: { label: 'Frontend (React)', type: 'Client' } },\r\n    { id: '2', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 120 }, data: { label: 'API Gateway', type: 'Server' } },\r\n    { id: '3', type: 'custom', position: { x: 50, y: 240 }, data: { label: 'Auth Service', type: 'Service' } },\r\n    { id: '4', type: 'custom', position: { x: 450, y: 240 }, data: { label: 'Job Service', type: 'Service' } },\r\n    { id: '5', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 360 }, data: { label: 'MongoDB Atlas', type: 'Database' } }\r\n  ]}\r\n  edges={[\r\n    { id: 'e1-2', source: '1', target: '2', animated: true, markerEnd: { type: 'arrowclosed' } },\r\n    { id: 'e2-3', source: '2', target: '3', markerEnd: { type: 'arrowclosed' } },\r\n    { id: 'e2-4', source: '2', target: '4', markerEnd: { type: 'arrowclosed' } },\r\n    { id: 'e3-5', source: '3', target: '5', strokeDasharray: '5,5' },\r\n    { id: 'e4-5', source: '4', target: '5', strokeDasharray: '5,5' }\r\n  ]}\r\n>\r\n```tree\nAPI Gateway (Express)\n├── Auth Service (JWT)\n├── Job Service (CRUD)\n├── Application Service (ATS)\n└── User Service (Profiles)\n\nData Layer\n└── MongoDB Atlas (Distributed Document Store)\n\nFrontend (React)\n├── React Query (Server State)\n├── TailwindCSS (Styling)\n└── RBAC Guard (Client-side Security)\n```\r\n</ProjectArchitecture>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Impact & Results\r\n\r\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16\">\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Active Users\" value=\"2k+\" description=\"Grew from 0 to 2000+ monthly active users in 3 months.\" />\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Load Time\" value=\"0.8s\" description=\"Optimized with server-side rendering and asset compression.\" />\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Hiring Efficiency\" value=\"+40%\" description=\"Reduced recruiter response time by automating pipeline management.\" />\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n<FeatureGrid>\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Integrated ATS\" \r\n    description=\"Drag-and-drop kanban board for managing candidate pipelines from 'Applied' to 'Hired'.\"\r\n    icon={Layout}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Infinite Discovery\" \r\n    description=\"Optimized job feed with infinite scroll, powered by React Query and Intersection Observer.\"\r\n    icon={Activity}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Role-Based Access\" \r\n    description=\"Strict separation of Recruiters and Job Seekers with granular permissions.\"\r\n    icon={Shield}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Resume Generator\" \r\n    description=\"Built-in tool for job seekers to generate professional resumes directly on the platform.\"\r\n    icon={FileText}\r\n  />\r\n</FeatureGrid>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Technical Challenges\r\n\r\n<ChallengeCard\r\n  title=\"Efficient Data Pagination\"\r\n  problem=\"Loading thousands of job postings caused severe UI lag and high server response times as the dataset grew.\"\r\n  solution=\"Implemented cursor-based pagination on the backend and utilized React Query's useInfiniteQuery alongside the Intersection Observer API on the frontend.\"\r\n  result=\"Sub-50ms interaction latency with zero layout shift during discovery.\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n<ChallengeCard\r\n  title=\"Secure Multi-Tenant Access\"\r\n  problem=\"Recruiters and applicants share the same backend, requiring foolproof separation of data and privileges.\"\r\n  solution=\"Designed a custom RBAC middleware that validates JWT claims against resource ownership and role permissions on every request.\"\r\n  result=\"Zero reported privilege escalation vulnerabilities during testing.\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Project Structure\r\n\r\n<ProjectTree>\r\n  <Folder name=\"client\" id=\"client\">\r\n    <Folder name=\"src\" id=\"client-src\">\r\n      <Folder name=\"components\" id=\"client-components\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"hooks\" id=\"client-hooks\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"pages\" id=\"client-pages\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"store\" id=\"client-store\" />\r\n    </Folder>\r\n  </Folder>\r\n  <Folder name=\"server\" id=\"server\">\r\n    <Folder name=\"controllers\" id=\"server-controllers\" />\r\n    <Folder name=\"middleware\" id=\"server-middleware\" />\r\n    <Folder name=\"models\" id=\"server-models\" />\r\n    <Folder name=\"routes\" id=\"server-routes\" />\r\n  </Folder>\r\n</ProjectTree>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## API Reference\r\n\r\n<ApiDialog>\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"GET\" \r\n    path=\"/api/jobs\" \r\n    description=\"Fetch all available job postings with cursor-based pagination.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"POST\" \r\n    path=\"/api/jobs\" \r\n    description=\"Create a new job posting. Requires Recruiter role.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"GET\" \r\n    path=\"/api/applications/:jobId\" \r\n    description=\"Retrieve all applications for a specific job. Recruiter only.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"PUT\" \r\n    path=\"/api/applications/:id/status\" \r\n    description=\"Update candidate status in the ATS pipeline.\" \r\n  />\r\n</ApiDialog>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Performance Optimizations\r\n\r\n<MetricsTable>\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Interaction Latency\" value=\"< 50ms\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Lighthouse Score\" value=\"95+\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"DB Query Time\" value=\"< 20ms\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Bundle Size\" value=\"Reduced by 40%\" />\r\n</MetricsTable>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Lessons Learned\r\n\r\n*   **Server State Management:** Mastering React Query for complex data synchronization.\r\n*   **Security Patterns:** Implementing robust JWT-based RBAC in Node.js.\r\n*   **Performance:** Optimizing React rendering for large, dynamic lists.\r\n*   **UX Design:** Building intuitive drag-and-drop workflows for enterprise-like tools.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n<ImageGallery \r\n  images={[\r\n    { src: \"/projects/job-portal/index.png\", alt: \"Job Discovery Feed\", title: \"Job Discovery Feed\" },\r\n    { src: \"/projects/job-portal/index.png\", alt: \"Recruiter Dashboard\", title: \"Recruiter Dashboard\" }\r\n  ]}\r\n/>",
