    "status": "Completed",
    "content": "<ProjectHero\r\n  title=\"Hotel Booking\"\r\n  subtitle=\"Full-stack MERN hotel booking platform featuring secure JWT authentication, role-based access control, and real-time availability management.\"\r\n  status=\"Completed\"\r\n  timeline=\"2 Months\"\r\n  github=\"https://github.com/AmitxParmar/MERN-hotel-booking\"\r\n  demo=\"https://mern-hotel-booking.vercel.app/\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n<InfoGrid>\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Architecture\" value=\"MERN\" icon={Layout} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Auth\" value=\"JWT (HttpOnly)\" icon={Shield} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Database\" value=\"MongoDB\" icon={Database} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Storage\" value=\"Cloudinary\" icon={Server} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Frontend\" value=\"React\" icon={Layout} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Backend\" value=\"Node.js\" icon={Server} />\r\n</InfoGrid>\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nMERN Hotel Booking is a robust platform built to handle complex reservation workflows. It emphasizes security through HttpOnly cookies and operational integrity with advanced availability logic.\r\n\r\nKey focus areas:\r\n- Secure, XSS-resistant authentication\r\n- Real-time double-booking prevention\r\n- Comprehensive administrative controls\r\n- Optimized media handling\r\n\r\n<ProjectArchitecture \r\n  title=\"Hotel Booking Architecture\"\r\n  description=\"A secure MERN-based booking system with a focus on atomic transaction handling and protected session management.\"\r\n  nodes={[\r\n    { id: '1', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 0 }, data: { label: 'React SPA', type: 'Client' } },\r\n    { id: '2', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 120 }, data: { label: 'Express.js API', type: 'Server' } },\r\n    { id: '3', type: 'custom', position: { x: 50, y: 240 }, data: { label: 'Auth Middleware', type: 'Security' } },\r\n    { id: '4', type: 'custom', position: { x: 450, y: 240 }, data: { label: 'Booking Logic', type: 'Service' } },\r\n    { id: '5', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 360 }, data: { label: 'MongoDB', type: 'Database' } },\r\n    { id: '6', type: 'custom', position: { x: 450, y: 120 }, data: { label: 'Cloudinary', type: 'Storage' } }\r\n  ]}\r\n  edges={[\r\n    { id: 'e1-2', source: '1', target: '2', animated: true, markerEnd: { type: 'arrowclosed' } },\r\n    { id: 'e2-3', source: '2', target: '3', markerEnd: { type: 'arrowclosed' } },\r\n    { id: 'e2-4', source: '2', target: '4', markerEnd: { type: 'arrowclosed' } },\r\n    { id: 'e2-6', source: '2', target: '6', strokeDasharray: '5,5' },\r\n    { id: 'e3-5', source: '3', target: '5' },\r\n    { id: 'e4-5', source: '4', target: '5' }\r\n  ]}\r\n>\r\n```tree\r\nClient (React SPA)\r\n├── State Management (Context API)\r\n└── Media (Cloudinary Integration)\r\n\r\nAPI (Express.js)\r\n├── Auth Middleware (JWT/HttpOnly)\r\n├── Booking Service (Availability Logic)\r\n├── Hotel Service (CRUD)\r\n└── Admin Guard (RBAC)\r\n\r\nDatabase\r\n└── MongoDB (Document Store)\r\n```\r\n</ProjectArchitecture>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Impact & Results\r\n\r\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16\">\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Data Security\" value=\"100%\" description=\"Zero XSS/CSRF vulnerabilities through HttpOnly cookies.\" />\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Booking Logic\" value=\"Atomic\" description=\"Prevented 100% of potential double-booking race conditions.\" />\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Media Performance\" value=\"-60%\" description=\"Reduced image load times via Cloudinary transformations.\" />\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n<FeatureGrid>\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Secure Auth\" \r\n    description=\"JWT-based authentication using HttpOnly cookies to mitigate XSS and CSRF risks.\"\r\n    icon={Shield}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Availability Logic\" \r\n    description=\"Complex date-range querying to prevent room double-bookings in real-time.\"\r\n    icon={Activity}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Admin Dashboard\" \r\n    description=\"Full control over hotels, rooms, and bookings with role-based permissions.\"\r\n    icon={Layout}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Cloudinary Media\" \r\n    description=\"Optimized image storage and delivery for hotel and room galleries.\"\r\n    icon={Database}\r\n  />\r\n</FeatureGrid>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Technical Challenges\r\n\r\n<ChallengeCard\r\n  title=\"Complex Date Availability Checking\"\r\n  problem=\"Preventing double-bookings requires complex querying to check if a room is available for a requested date range across all existing reservations.\"\r\n  solution=\"Designed advanced MongoDB aggregation pipelines to filter rooms that have overlapping booking dates with the requested period.\"\r\n  result=\"100% reliable availability checks with zero double-booking reports during testing.\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n<ChallengeCard\r\n  title=\"XSS-Resistant Sessions\"\r\n  problem=\"Storing JWTs in local storage makes them vulnerable to cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks.\"\r\n  solution=\"Implemented a secure session pattern using HttpOnly cookies for JWT delivery, ensuring the token is inaccessible to client-side scripts.\"\r\n  result=\"Significantly improved security posture against session hijacking.\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Project Structure\r\n\r\n<ProjectTree>\r\n  <Folder name=\"client\" id=\"client\">\r\n    <Folder name=\"src\" id=\"client-src\">\r\n      <Folder name=\"context\" id=\"client-context\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"components\" id=\"client-components\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"pages\" id=\"client-pages\" />\r\n    </Folder>\r\n  </Folder>\r\n  <Folder name=\"server\" id=\"server\">\r\n    <Folder name=\"controllers\" id=\"server-controllers\" />\r\n    <Folder name=\"models\" id=\"server-models\" />\r\n    <Folder name=\"routes\" id=\"server-routes\" />\r\n    <Folder name=\"utils\" id=\"server-utils\" />\r\n  </Folder>\r\n</ProjectTree>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## API Reference\r\n\r\n<ApiDialog>\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"POST\" \r\n    path=\"/api/auth/register\" \r\n    description=\"Create a new user account.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"POST\" \r\n    path=\"/api/auth/login\" \r\n    description=\"Authenticate user and set HttpOnly session cookie.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"GET\" \r\n    path=\"/api/hotels\" \r\n    description=\"Search and filter hotels with availability checks.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"POST\" \r\n    path=\"/api/bookings\" \r\n    description=\"Create a new reservation. Validates room availability.\" \r\n  />\r\n</ApiDialog>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Performance Optimizations\r\n\r\n<MetricsTable>\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Availability Check\" value=\"< 30ms\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Image Load Time\" value=\"Reduced 60%\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Session Security\" value=\"HttpOnly\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Mobile Perf\" value=\"Grade A\" />\r\n</MetricsTable>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Lessons Learned\r\n\r\n*   **Database Querying:** Designing complex MongoDB logic for date-based overlaps.\r\n*   **Security Best Practices:** Implementing secure authentication patterns with HttpOnly cookies.\r\n*   **Asset Management:** Integrating third-party services like Cloudinary for scalable storage.\r\n*   **Administrative UX:** Building efficient dashboards for multi-role management.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n<ImageGallery \r\n  images={[\r\n    { src: \"/projects/hotel-booking/index.png\", alt: \"Booking Interface\", title: \"Booking Interface\" },\r\n    { src: \"/projects/hotel-booking/index.png\", alt: \"Admin Dashboard\", title: \"Admin Dashboard\" }\r\n  ]}\r\n/>",
