    "title": "Streamio",
    "description": "React-based video platform powered by YouTube Data API",
    "tech": [
      "React",
      "MUI",
      "Axios",
      "YouTube API"
    ],
    "featured": false,
    "year": "2022",
    "role": [
      "Frontend Developer"
    ],
    "github": "https://github.com/AmitxParmar/youtube-clone",
    "demo": "https://startling-croissant-d44195.netlify.app/",
    "cover": "/projects/streamio/index.png",
    "status": "Completed",
    "content": "<ProjectHero\r\n  title=\"Streamio\"\r\n  subtitle=\"React-based video streaming platform powered by the YouTube Data API, featuring a custom video player and detailed search discovery.\"\r\n  status=\"Completed\"\r\n  timeline=\"1 Month\"\r\n  github=\"https://github.com/AmitxParmar/youtube-clone\"\r\n  demo=\"https://startling-croissant-d44195.netlify.app/\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n<InfoGrid>\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Framework\" value=\"React\" icon={Layout} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"UI Kit\" value=\"Material UI\" icon={Layout} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"API\" value=\"YouTube v3\" icon={Server} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"HTTP\" value=\"Axios\" icon={Activity} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Hosting\" value=\"Netlify\" icon={Server} />\r\n  <InfoCard title=\"Type\" value=\"Frontend\" icon={Layout} />\r\n</InfoGrid>\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nStreamio is a high-fidelity video discovery platform built to demonstrate complex third-party API integration and modern responsive UI design. It provides a seamless viewing experience with optimized data fetching to respect API quotas.\r\n\r\nKey focus areas:\r\n- High-performance API integration\r\n- Custom themed component library\r\n- Fluid, responsive video layouts\r\n- Intuitive search and discovery\r\n\r\n<ProjectArchitecture \r\n  title=\"Frontend Architecture\"\r\n  description=\"A modular React application designed for high-fidelity media discovery, leveraging the YouTube Data API with optimized request pooling.\"\r\n  nodes={[\r\n    { id: '1', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 0 }, data: { label: 'React Application', type: 'Frontend' } },\r\n    { id: '2', type: 'custom', position: { x: 250, y: 150 }, data: { label: 'YouTube Data API', type: 'External Service' } },\r\n    { id: '3', type: 'custom', position: { x: 50, y: 150 }, data: { label: 'MUI Theme', type: 'UI System' } },\r\n    { id: '4', type: 'custom', position: { x: 450, y: 150 }, data: { label: 'Axios Instance', type: 'Network' } }\r\n  ]}\r\n  edges={[\r\n    { id: 'e1-2', source: '1', target: '2', animated: true },\r\n    { id: 'e1-3', source: '1', target: '3' },\r\n    { id: 'e1-4', source: '1', target: '4' }\r\n  ]}\r\n>\r\n```tree\r\nFrontend Application (React)\r\n├── State Management (Hooks/Context)\r\n├── UI Foundation (Material UI Custom Theme)\r\n└── Data Layer (Axios + YouTube Data API v3)\r\n\r\nExternal Services\r\n└── YouTube Data API (Video Metadata, Search, Statistics)\r\n```\r\n</ProjectArchitecture>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Impact & Results\r\n\r\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16\">\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Reusable Components\" value=\"20+\" description=\"Modular UI architecture for rapid feature development.\" />\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"API Efficiency\" value=\"Optimal\" description=\"Strategically managed requests to stay within 10k daily quota.\" />\r\n  <ProjectStat label=\"Device Coverage\" value=\"100%\" description=\"Pixel-perfect responsiveness across all screen dimensions.\" />\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n<FeatureGrid>\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Custom Video Player\" \r\n    description=\"Integrated playback experience with related video suggestions and channel metadata.\"\r\n    icon={Layout}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Intelligent Search\" \r\n    description=\"Global search functionality with category filtering for rapid content discovery.\"\r\n    icon={Activity}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Responsive Grid\" \r\n    description=\"Fluid video discovery layout that adapts seamlessly from mobile to desktop environments.\"\r\n    icon={Layout}\r\n  />\r\n  <FeatureCard \r\n    title=\"Quota Optimization\" \r\n    description=\"Strategically managed API requests to maximize the efficiency of daily quota limits.\"\r\n    icon={Server}\r\n  />\r\n</FeatureGrid>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Technical Challenges\r\n\r\n<ChallengeCard\r\n  title=\"Optimizing API Quota Usage\"\r\n  problem=\"The YouTube Data API has strict daily quota limits (10,000 units). Redundant or inefficient requests can quickly exhaust these limits.\"\r\n  solution=\"Implemented a centralized data fetching layer with efficient state management to ensure each piece of metadata is fetched only when necessary and reused across components.\"\r\n  result=\"Maximized platform availability, ensuring a full day of browsing without hitting API rate limits.\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n<ChallengeCard\r\n  title=\"Consistent Cross-Device Experience\"\r\n  problem=\"Building a complex, media-heavy interface that feels native and responsive across all screen sizes.\"\r\n  solution=\"Leveraged Material UI's (MUI) powerful grid and breakpoint system, customizing the global theme to create a unique brand identity while maintaining accessibility standards.\"\r\n  result=\"A polished, consistent UI with 100% responsiveness and high accessibility scores.\"\r\n/>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Project Structure\r\n\r\n<ProjectTree>\r\n  <Folder name=\"src\" id=\"src\">\r\n    <Folder name=\"components\" id=\"components\">\r\n      <Folder name=\"VideoCard\" id=\"video-card\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"SearchBar\" id=\"search-bar\" />\r\n      <Folder name=\"VideoPlayer\" id=\"video-player\" />\r\n    </Folder>\r\n    <Folder name=\"utils\" id=\"utils\">\r\n      <File name=\"fetchFromAPI.js\" id=\"api-util\" />\r\n    </Folder>\r\n    <Folder name=\"pages\" id=\"pages\">\r\n      <File name=\"Feed.jsx\" id=\"feed-page\" />\r\n      <File name=\"VideoDetail.jsx\" id=\"video-page\" />\r\n    </Folder>\r\n  </Folder>\r\n</ProjectTree>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## API Reference\r\n\r\n<ApiDialog>\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"GET\" \r\n    path=\"/search\" \r\n    description=\"Fetch videos, channels, or playlists based on query parameters.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"GET\" \r\n    path=\"/videos\" \r\n    description=\"Retrieve detailed metadata and statistics for a specific video ID.\" \r\n  />\r\n  <ApiEndpoint \r\n    method=\"GET\" \r\n    path=\"/channels\" \r\n    description=\"Fetch channel information including subscriber counts and featured content.\" \r\n  />\r\n</ApiDialog>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Performance Optimizations\r\n\r\n<MetricsTable>\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"UI Components\" value=\"20+ Reusable\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Responsive Breakpoints\" value=\"5 (Mobile to 4K)\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"API Latency\" value=\"Minimal (Optimized)\" />\r\n  <MetricRow label=\"Bundle Size\" value=\"Tree-shaken\" />\r\n</MetricsTable>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Lessons Learned\r\n\r\n*   **Third-party Integration:** Mastering the intricacies of the YouTube Data API v3.\r\n*   **Quota Management:** Designing applications to thrive under strict rate limits.\r\n*   **Theming & Styling:** Customizing design systems (MUI) for unique brand aesthetics.\r\n*   **Async Patterns:** Handling complex loading states and error boundaries in React.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n<ImageGallery \r\n  images={[\r\n    { src: \"/projects/streamio/index.png\", alt: \"Video Discovery Feed\", title: \"Global Discovery Feed\" },\r\n    { src: \"/projects/streamio/index.png\", alt: \"Custom Video Player\", title: \"Immersive Playback View\" }\r\n  ]}\r\n/>",
